[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8640.07, "timestamp": "02:24:00", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8663.03, "timestamp": "02:24:23", "text": "即使是那匹机敏的马，也有像这样安静的时刻。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8670.95, "timestamp": "02:24:30", "text": "是的，艾姆斯曾是我的学生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8673.59, "timestamp": "02:24:33", "text": "所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8677.15, "timestamp": "02:24:37", "text": "在我教的那节课结束时，她还是个新人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8680.63, "timestamp": "02:24:40", "text": "我在调查表上写道，我会拯救世界。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8682.63, "timestamp": "02:24:42", "text": "哟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8686.87, "timestamp": "02:24:46", "text": "她没有生气，只是笑了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8690.87, "timestamp": "02:24:50", "text": "他拿着调查表离开了，再也没有回来。"}]